## Lessons Learned

Wireshark provides significantly more visibility than basic network utilities because it allows individual packets and protocol fields to be examined.

Using packet captures alongside Linux and Windows networking commands provides multiple layers of visibility when troubleshooting or investigating network activity.

The lab also demonstrated the importance of understanding normal network traffic before attempting to identify anomalous behavior.

